                <th scope="row" class="text-left p-3 font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-ink);">Calculate Portion</th>
                <td class="p-3 font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">=A1*B1</td>
                <td class="p-3">Multiplies total in A1 by rate in B1 (e.g., $100 * 20% = $20)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b" style="border-color: var(--border-hairline);">
                <th scope="row" class="text-left p-3 font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-ink);">Find Percentage Share</th>
                <td class="p-3 font-mono font-bold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">=A1/B1</td>
                <td class="p-3">Format cell as % (e.g., 25 / 200 = 12.5%)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b" style="border-color: var(--border-hairline);">
                <th scope="row" class="text-left p-3 font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-ink);">Apply Discount</th>
                <td class="p-3 font-mono font-bold text-pink-600 dark:text-pink-400">=A1*(1-B1)</td>
                <td class="p-3">Deducts percentage B1 from price A1 (e.g., $80 * (1 - 0.3) = $56)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row" class="text-left p-3 font-semibold" style="color: var(--text-ink);">Percentage Growth</th>
                <td class="p-3 font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">=(B1-A1)/A1</td>
                <td class="p-3">Calculates increase/decrease from old A1 to new B1</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
